.TH LIBRDP-COCOA-ADMIN 1 "2026-07-15" "librdp 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
librdp-cocoa-admin \- native macOS RDS administration tool for librdp
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B librdp-cocoa-admin
.B --endpoint
.I url
[
.I options
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B librdp-cocoa-admin
queries remote administration inventory through the public librdp admin API and displays a Cocoa summary window unless
.B --no-window
is supplied. It can also execute bounded remote actions through the configured admin transport.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --endpoint " url"
Administration endpoint URL.
.TP
.BI --user " name"
Endpoint user name.
.TP
.BI --password " value"
Endpoint password. Avoid placing credentials in shell history on shared systems.
.TP
.BI --password-env " name"
Read the endpoint password from an environment variable.
.TP
.BI --domain " name"
Authentication domain.
.TP
.BI --resource-uri " uri"
Override the management resource URI.
.TP
.BI --timeout " ms"
Operation timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
.B --insecure-lab
Disable TLS verification for explicit lab use.
.TP
.BI --action " query|logoff|disconnect|message"
Query sessions or execute an action.
.TP
.BI --session-id " id"
Target session identifier for actions.
.TP
.BI --message-title " text"
Optional message title.
.TP
.BI --message-text " text"
Message body for the message action.
.TP
.B --confirm
Required for logoff and disconnect.
.TP
.B --no-window
Run only as a command-line tool.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR librdp (7),
.BR librdp-api (7)
